: \"percentage of cases with poliovirus isolation results available within 28 days of receipt of specimen (target: > 80%)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Laboratory performance quality is evaluated through a WHO accreditation program that includes proficiency testing, annual performance review\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}